McDiarmid http://orcid.org/0000-0002-7668-7860 Michelle Harvie http://orcid.org/0000-0001-9761-3089 Azza Aglan http://orcid.org/0000-0001-5756-397X Hannah Winterbottom http://orcid.org/0000-0001-9944-8697 Womba Mubita http://orcid.org/0000-0001-6362-9883 Amanda Hulme http://orcid.org/0000-0001-9823-0725 Jane Davies http://orcid.org/0000-0001-6366-9324, ord=176], PassageDto[id=E-0001-0177, section=ORCID iDs, kind=paragraph, page=9, bbox={l=306.8859, t=190.84010000000023, r=459.1018999999996, b=197.8513961373393}, page_width=595.2760009765625, page_height=793.7009887695312, text=Basil G Issa http://orcid.org/0000-0001-5681-2698, ord=177], PassageDto[id=E-0001-0178, section=REFERENCES, kind=list, page=9, bbox={l=313.1655, t=249.4371, r=545.5229999999997, b=264.4933500000001}, page_width=595.2760009765625, page_height=793.7009887695312, text=1 JDRF. n.d. Available: https://jdrf.org.uk/information-support/abouttype-1-diabetes/facts-and-figures/, ord=178], PassageDto[id=E-0001-0179, section=REFERENCES, kind=list, page=9, bbox={l=313.158, t=266.4321, r=541.7505, b=332.47335000000004}, page_width=595.2760009765625, page_height=793.7009887695312, text=2 Nathan DM, Zinman B, Cleary PA, et al. Diabetes control and complications trial, epidemiology of diabetes interventions and complications (DCCT/EDIC) research group. modern-­day clinical course of type 1 diabetes mellitus after 30 years' duration: the diabetes control and complications trial/epidemiology of diabetes interventions and complications and Pittsburgh epidemiology of diabetes complications experience (1983-­2005). Arch Intern Med 2009;169:1307., ord=179], PassageDto[id=E-0001-0180, section=REFERENCES, kind=list, page=9, bbox={l=313.1505, t=334.4121, r=550.0979999999996, b=357.96585000000005}, page_width=595.2760009765625, page_height=793.7009887695312, text=3 Cantley NW, Lonnen K, Kyrou I, et al. The association between overweight/obesity and double diabetes in adults with type 1 diabetes; a cross-­sectional study.